Source-sentence publication rights are a separate concern. Each corpus source
must have explicit provenance, licence, attribution, and rights status in
`data/sources/`. A source whose rights are pending, blocked, unknown, or
incompatible must not be included in public output.

This repository does not contain the proposed 10,000-sentence corpus. Any future
corpus remains subject to its supplied source licence and attribution terms.
